{"term": {"label": "禮", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "3A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/teng-wen-gong-i", "title": "滕文公上", "description": "滕文公為世子，將之楚，過宋而見孟子。孟子道性善，言必稱堯舜。\n世子自楚反，復見孟子。孟子曰：「世子疑吾言乎？夫道一而已矣。成覸謂齊景公曰：『彼丈夫也，我丈夫也，吾何畏彼哉？』顏淵曰：『舜何人也？予何人也？有為者亦若是。』公明儀曰：『文王我師也，周公豈欺我哉？』今滕，絕長補短，將五十里也，猶可以為善國。《書》曰：『若藥不", "occurrences": 5, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "下", "id": "下"}, {"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "倍", "id": "倍"}, {"form": "入", "id": "入"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "學", "id": "學"}, {"form": "師", "id": "師"}, {"form": "序", "id": "序"}, {"form": "死", "id": "死"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "耕", "id": "耕"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}, {"form": "葬", "id": "葬"}, {"form": "親", "id": "親"}, {"form": "賢", "id": "賢"}, {"form": "食", "id": "食"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.571339155560308, "source": "葬", "target": "死"}, {"weight": 2.283657083108527, "source": "葬", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 2.571339155560308, "source": "葬", "target": "至"}, {"weight": 2.165874047452143, "source": "葬", "target": "親"}, {"weight": 1.3673663512343717, "source": "下", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.283657083108527, "source": "下", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 2.571339155560308, "source": "下", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 1.472726866892198, "source": "下", "target": "親"}, {"weight": 2.571339155560308, "source": "下", "target": "入"}, {"weight": 0.6617966506758692, "source": "親", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 1.760408939343979, "source": "親", "target": "死"}, {"weight": 4.363098624788363, "source": "倍", "target": "師"}, {"weight": 3.264486336120253, "source": "倍", "target": "死"}, {"weight": 2.4171884757330493, "source": "倍", "target": "學"}, {"weight": 3.1103356562929947, "source": "序", "target": "學"}, {"weight": 1.3673663512343717, "source": "君", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 2.348195604246098, "source": "君", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 1.472726866892198, "source": "禮", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.571339155560308, "source": "禮", "targ